[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11762.07, "timestamp": "03:16:02", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11772.87, "timestamp": "03:16:12", "text": "好的。哦，对了，还有浆果。我曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11776.71, "timestamp": "03:16:16", "text": "用这些浆果恢复我的生命值。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11778.229, "timestamp": "03:16:18", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11781.269, "timestamp": "03:16:21", "text": "还记得杜基桑出现的那个片段吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11783.91, "timestamp": "03:16:23", "text": "我也在玩，然后我把你推死了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11786.55, "timestamp": "03:16:26", "text": "哦是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11789.59, "timestamp": "03:16:29", "text": "我的天啊。所以，是的，对于那些不了解的人来说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11793.91, "timestamp": "03:16:33", "text": "要知道，这是我的基地。我曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11797.51, "timestamp": "03:16:37", "text": "是的。我的天啊。我的天啊。猫和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11801.51, "timestamp": "03:16:41", "text": "狗。我的孩子们。这些蘑菇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11803.19, "timestamp": "03:16:43", "text": "我们把它们收集起来了。就像你们俩一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11806.63, "timestamp": "03:16:46", "text": "收集了它们。是啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11811.03, "timestamp": "03:16:51", "text": "动物、我们的主要农场等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11813.03, "timestamp": "03:16:53", "text": "这里以前是我们常去的农场。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11818.15, "timestamp": "03:16:58", "text": "而这原本应该是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11819.83, "timestamp": "03:16:59", "text": "扩大。"}]